## Code state

After T-001, PR #17 and PR #18 were merged into `main`; the working tree is now on `main` `16d08888`. Between `5ff1b512` and `16d08888` only tests and scripts changed under `packages/`, no runtime code. Protocol run C at `16d08888` equals protocol run A at `5ff1b512` in every non-timing metric with identical server, dispatcher and SDK digests. The baseline therefore uses protocol run C and native run 3, both at `16d08888`.

